stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reserved: order reserve begins
    Reserved --> Paid: payment capture
    Paid --> Complete: inventory commit succeeds
    Paid --> Compensating: inventory commit fails
    Compensating --> Failed: release inventory then reverse payment
    Complete --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
